    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26673" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">līnāmentum</span></b> , i,
			n.
		linum, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>linen-stuff, linen</i> (post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen., plur.,
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				32, 10, 46, § 129</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In partic., <i>lint</i>, <i><span class="en">Col. 6, 11, 7</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">applicare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					6, 12, 10</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">suppurationem linamentis curare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					6, 38, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">linamentum demittere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels. 7,
					9</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">indere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					5, 6, 23</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">imponere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					5, 6, 30</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">siccis linamentis vulnus implere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					5, 6, 21</span></i>
			.</div>
